  "text": "Before introducing ACI in more detail, this slide provides a quick overview of the ISCE² organizational structure. Here, you can see where ACI sits within the Institute. ACI is led by our Division Director, Andrew Lim. In the next few slides, I will introduce our team and highlight the key analytical capabilities and shared scientific resources that we offer.",
