 "3": {
  "duration": 51.792,
  "text": "ACI is organised into three technical domains, chromatography and mass spectrometry, X-ray spectroscopy and microscopy, and NMR, physical and thermal characterisation. Together, our domain leads and staff manage a broad range of shared scientific resources and provide analytical and characterisation support, as well as technical training, to our research community. Beyond supporting our internal R&D activities, we also extend our capabilities to industry partners, providing services such as material characterisation, failure diagnostics, method development, consultancy, and collaboration. Through these capabilities, we aim to provide practical analytical solutions to support different research and industry needs.",
