 "4": {
  "duration": 90.802,
  "text": "The ACI division is led by our division director, Andrew Lim, and Ong Li Li as the Division Deputy Director. And it comprises three technical domains, each led by our respective domain lead. The Chromatography and Mass Spectrometry domain is led by Mr. Ong Wai Chung, supported by our instrument specialists, Ng Fu Song and Tan Kuan Yi. The X-ray Spectroscopy and Microscopy domain is led by Ms. Angeline Seo, together with three senior domain specialists, Wang Zhan, Chia Sze Chen, and Cao Xun, who specialize in XPS, XRD and TEM respectively. Ong Li Li also served as the domain lead of NMR, Physical and Thermal Characterisation, supported by instrument specialists Yeo Wen Cong and Kuan Kai Cong. Beyond our analytical and characterisation work, ACI also plays an important role in managing shared scientific resources across the Institute. Our responsibilities include equipment booking, utilisation and charging, demand aggregation, scientific equipment and systems refresh, and equipment lifecycle management. We also support digitalisation and sustainability initiatives. Together, these activities help ensure that our scientific resources are effectively managed, optimised, and kept relevant to support the evolving research needs across the Institute.",
